{"title": "Great Wyrm's Scales", "pageid": 40347, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Great_Wyrm's_Scales", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Wyrm%27s_Scales\" title=\"Greater Wyrm's Scales\">Greater Wyrm's Scales</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Multiattack_Defense.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Multiattack_Defense.webp/300px-Multiattack_Defense.webp, /w/images/6/60/Multiattack_Defense.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Multiattack_Defense.webp/300px-Multiattack_Defense.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Multiattack_Defense.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Great Wyrm's Scales</b> is a passive feature that grants a creature damage reduction against all incoming attacks\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>All incoming damage is reduced by 2. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_Red_Dragon\" title=\"Dominated Red Dragon\">Dominated Red Dragon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Qudenos\" title=\"Qudenos\">Qudenos</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202136\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time us